WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.940
And she can ask in her own language.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.280
Here, I ask in Nepali: where are my glasses?

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.740
Gemini answers in Nepali, beside the same
image.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.220
The words change.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.240
The support stays personal.
